  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi></math> be the set of all real values of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>k</mi></math> for which the system of linear equations<br /><math><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br /><math><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math><br /><math><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math><br />has a unique solution. Then, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi><mo>&#160;</mo></math>is :"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "equal to <math><mi>R</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mo>–</mo><mo>{</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>}</mo></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "an empty set",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "equal to&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "equal to&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\"><mn>0</mn></mfenced></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "A"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>For unique solution,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8710;</mo><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>k</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>1</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Thus,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>-</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mn>0</mn></mfenced></math></p>"
  }
}